{{- /*
chezmoi-driven Windows bootstrap. Auto-runs during `chezmoi apply` when this
rendered content changes (e.g., editing .chezmoidata/packages.yaml).

Windows has no bash, so the body is a PowerShell one of its own rather than
.chezmoitemplates/setup-body.sh. Body shared with setup.ps1.tmpl via
.chezmoitemplates/setup-body.ps1 so the chezmoi-driven path and the manual
~/setup.ps1 stay byte-identical.

Renders empty (chezmoi skips it) on non-Windows.
*/ -}}
{{- if eq .chezmoi.os "windows" -}}
{{ template "setup-body.ps1" . }}
{{- end -}}
